n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The Oak Depot</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$444</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Decoration</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.0.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">January 14th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Cheese</b> can be bought at <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a> for $444.   \n</p><p>There are <b>1194 possible different colors</b><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> of cheese. Each piece of cheese has a <b>1/2000</b> chance to be neon<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.  \n</p><p>The color of cheese can be checked using <a href=\"/wiki/Filter_Conveyor\" title=\"Filter Conveyor\">Filter Conveyor</a>, it will appear as \"(Item Cheese) <b>color</b>: <i>#Hex</i>\".\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Trivia_.2B_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia_+_Gallery\">Trivia + Gallery</span></h2>\n<p>-There are <b>2388</b> unique cheeses you can obtain, half of which are <b>neon</b>.\n</p><p>-It would take you 888000K to get one neon.\n</p><p>-In older versions of Oaklands, cheese with a hexcode that has 2 of the colors set to FF could not be obtained Eg.(FF38FF)\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/6d/Rainbow_Cheese.gif/revision/latest?cb=20240421061836\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Rainbow Cheese\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/6d/Rainbow_Cheese.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20240421061836\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Rainbow Cheese.gif\" data-image-key=\"Rainbow_Cheese.gif\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Rainbow_Cheese.gif\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 276px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/00/CHEESE_trans.png/revision/latest?cb=20241217235003\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Neon Yellow Cheese\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"276\" height=\"135\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"CHEESE trans.png\" data-image-key=\"CHEESE_trans.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/00/CHEESE_trans.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/276?cb=20241217235003\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/00/CHEESE_trans.png/revision/latest?cb=20241217235003\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Neon Yellow Cheese\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/00/CHEESE_trans.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/276?cb=20241217235003\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"276\" height=\"135\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"CHEESE trans.png\" data-image-key=\"CHEESE_trans.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/00/CHEESE_trans.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/276?cb=20241217235003\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:CHEESE_trans.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Neon Yellow Cheese. (best of all the cheeses)</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>In pre-release this item used to have a cubic hitbox.\n<span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/22/Neon_Pink_Cheese.png/revision/latest?cb=20240805021057\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Neon Pink Cheese\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"271\" height=\"153\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Neon Pink Cheese.png\" data-image-key=\"Neon_Pink_Cheese.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/22/Neon_Pink_Cheese.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/271?cb=20240805021057\" /></a></span>\n</p><p>Neon Pink Cheese\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Cheese uses a RGB hex system with values from 38(56) to ff(255). Only one of the colour values can have the range, while the other 2 are ff and 38. This makes a total of 1194 different colours a cheese can choose from. (<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1OUXumuS65elUodTi6t02eqyDhtd6lLNbP8Ew7Y0TrbE/edit?usp=sharing\">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1OUXumuS65elUodTi6t02eqyDhtd6lLNbP8Ew7Y0TrbE/edit?usp=sharing</a>)</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">This is a separate roll from the colour.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903150001\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 93/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 61/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1226/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019426/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.806      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   31.806      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:280-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903150001 and revision id 21304. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Items","Decorative_Item"],"links":[{"title":"Filter Con